  "气象接口暂时限流（短时并发过高），约一分钟内会自动恢复。": "The weather API is rate-limiting briefly (too many parallel calls); it should recover within about a minute.",
  "气象接口暂时限流（同一 IP 请求过于频繁），请稍候约 1 分钟后重试。": "The weather API is rate-limiting this IP; please retry in about a minute.",
  "请检查网络连接或稍后重试；也可能是该日期超出模式可提供的范围（可预报范围约 今天−7 天 ~ 今天+10 天）。": "Check your connection or retry later; the date may also be outside the model range (roughly today−7 days to today+10 days).",
  "请求未完成，无结果可展示。": "The request did not complete, so there is nothing to show.",
  "请先完成一次预报，再保存图片。": "Run a forecast first, then save the image.",
  "点位": "point",
  "预报时效约 {n} 小时": "Lead time about {n} h",
  "实况 / 历史分析场": "Analysis / historical field",
  "霞光预报 · 数据源 Open-Meteo（GFS / ECMWF-IFS / CAMS 气溶胶）· 结论仅供观赏参考": "Glowcast · Data: Open-Meteo (GFS / ECMWF-IFS / CAMS aerosol) · For viewing guidance only",
  "载霞云层 {v}": "Glow cloud {v}",
  "覆盖 {v}": "cover {v}",
