  "综合 I {v}": "blend I {v}",
  "气象接口响应超时（超过 12 秒），请检查网络后重试。": "The weather API timed out (over 12 s); check your connection and retry.",
  "数据获取失败：{v}": "Failed to fetch data: {v}",
  "额度会在次日重置，之后即可恢复。想继续使用的话：地图数据占单次首屏约 88% 的调用量，不点「加载周边地图」就不会消耗；也可以改用付费计划或自建实例。": "The quota resets tomorrow, so it will recover. To keep using it: the map accounts for about 88% of the calls in one first load, so simply not clicking \"Load map\" avoids that cost; a paid plan or a self-hosted instance is another option.",
  "点上方按钮加载趋势（最长 {n} 天，具体天数受模式可预报范围限制）—— 一次取数即可比较“哪天值得去”，不用一天天手动切。（会额外发一轮约 {c} 个坐标的请求。）": "Click the button above to load the outlook (up to {n} days; the exact span depends on the model range). One request compares every day at once, so you do not have to step through them. (It costs an extra round of about {c} coordinates.)",
  "区间 {a} ~ {b}；一次取数 {n} 个坐标（朝/晚霞共用），样带方位按 {a} 构造，其余日期有几公里量级的方位偏差；点任意格子可跳到该日期与该时段。": "Range {a} to {b}; one request covers {n} coordinates (shared by dawn and dusk). The transect azimuth is built for {a}, so other days carry an offset of a few kilometres. Click any cell to jump to that date and period.",
  "当前所选日期不在已加载区间内，点「重新加载趋势」更新。": "The selected date is outside the loaded range; click \"Reload outlook\" to update.",
  "本次缺少 {v} 数据，相应结论不确定性更高。": "This run is missing {v} data, so the conclusion is less certain.",
  "霞光相对亮度与彩度随时间的演变（横轴＝事件后分钟数，竖线＝各采样点的实际颜色）：": "Relative brightness and chroma of the glow over time (x-axis: minutes after the event; bars show the sampled colours):",
  "无明显云边界": "no clear cloud edge",
  "不足两套算法给出结果，无法评估模型一致性。": "Fewer than two algorithms returned results, so model agreement cannot be assessed.",
